        content
          CharData "Soliloquy"
        ETag
          TagName "title"
      CharData
        ""
        "            Life is but a walking shadow."
        "            A poor player that frets and strusts"
        "            His hour upon the stage, and then is heard no more;"
        "            It is a tale told by an idiot, full of sound and fury,"
        "            Signifying nothing."
        "        "
    ETag
      TagName "doc"